1
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:49,799
(Episode 10)

2
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:50,960
(This is a work of fiction.)

3
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:54,920
Did the staff member mean that...

4
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,920
once Australia confirms everything,

5
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,320
I can take Sze Ming and leave?

6
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:01,960
These cases usually take a day or two.

7
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:04,999
That's wonderful.

8
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,600
I can finally go home with her.

9
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,320
Calm down.

10
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,960
You will be back in Australia soon.

11
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:29,240
If you're unhappy or dissatisfied,

12
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,080
tell me slowly.

13
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,720
Don't get worked up.

14
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:38,320
I saw it clearly from the underworld.

15
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:41,240
He hasn't changed at all! He's lying!

16
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:44,120
Don't worry, Mr. Ma's stance hasn't changed.

17
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:46,720
I'll tell him. He'll get back to you as soon as possible.

18
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:50,600
Many people are calling for you.

19
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,560
The party chairman, the Glory Society...

20
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,640
They all want to know if your stance has changed.

21
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:57,080
Arrange meetings with them one by one.

22
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,120
- I'll explain to them personally. - Yes, sir.

23
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,840
I will not acknowledge that woman.

24
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,640
I will proceed with the judicial review.

25
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:08,960
I'm his daughter!

26
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:11,040
Why won't he accept me even now?

27
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:15,240
Do you know how it feels to be rejected...

28
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,840
by the person whose approval you want most?

29
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,280
I understand.

30
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,840
Of course I know how that feels.

31
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:23,920
- I... - No, you don't!

32
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:28,440
I need you to help me make him truly accept me!

33
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,120
That's impossible.

34
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:32,200
I can't do that.

35
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,200
I can't control what he thinks.

36
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,880
But you'll vanish if you go on like this.

37
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,560
You won't be able to go home with Cathy. Do you understand?

38
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:45,400
If you won't help me, I'll do it myself!

39
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:48,600
What happened? Did you see her?

40
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:53,599
There's no time.

41
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,000
Let's talk on the way. Get in.

42
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,640
Chairman, don't worry.

43
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,720
This is just an isolated incident.

44
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:02,880
My stance hasn't changed.

45
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:05,280
I don't want anyone else to go through...

46
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,960
something as ridiculous as I have.

47
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,960
I will continue to push...

48
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:10,040
for the judicial review no matter what.

49
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:12,880
I won't let this misinformation...

50
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:15,360
continue to spread in society.

51
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:17,400
Hello?

52
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,480
Why won't you just accept me?

53
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:36,880
Do you even consider me your daughter?

54
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,840
Marco, come in.

55
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,680
Help!

56
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,600
Help!

57
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:03,760
Help!

58
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,000
Help!

59
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:11,400
Mr. Ma, are you all right?

60
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,680
You didn't want me when I was alive!

61
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:26,200
Now that I'm dead, you won't let me rest in peace!

62
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,600
Since I was a child,

63
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:32,840
you wanted everything done your way.

64
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,760
If I didn't comply, I was in the wrong.

65
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,440
Have you ever thought about my feelings?

66
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:44,600
Mr. Ma!

67
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,800
Go find a locksmith.

68
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,160
Go!

69
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,920
Senior, calm down.

70
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,320
If you keep this up, there's no turning back.

71
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:01,680
He's my father! Why won't he accept me?

72
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,440
It's normal that he doesn't accept you.

73
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:05,840
Many parents are like that.

74
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:08,560
There's no guarantee a father will be good to his daughter.

75
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,560
My parents didn't want me either. So what?

76
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:15,560
It's your life. Being true to yourself is all that matters.

77
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:17,520
You can't force people to understand you.

78
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:20,600
You only need to care about those who truly care for you.

79
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,600
Not everyone will approve of you.

80
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,160
I don't need everyone's approval.

81
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:28,160
I never realized it until now.

82
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:31,160
What I wanted most was his recognition.

83
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:33,320
But he refuses to give it, even now.

84
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,800
Why?

85
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,360
Calm down. You shouldn't fade away because of a jerk like him.

86
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:40,440
Calm down.

87
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:45,920
Senior.

88
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,480
Senior.

89
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:54,520
Senior.

90
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:03,640
Sze Ming, are you there?

91
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,920
Can you listen to me for a moment?

92
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:08,120
You can't fade away.

93
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:11,240
You promised me we would be together forever.

94
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:13,560
You can't leave me behind.

95
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,040
Please don't leave me.

96
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:17,840
Don't go.

97
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:20,600
Don't leave me.

98
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,680
Don't come near me.

99
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,160
Go away!

100
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,920
Senior.

101
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,760
Cherish what you have.

102
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:31,080
Don't force what you can't obtain.

103
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:35,040
Sze Ming, do you remember what you told me?

104
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:38,640
In life or in death, we have to be together forever.

105
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,520
Sze Ming, I beg you.

106
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:44,640
I beg you, don't hurt yourself.

107
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,040
I beg you.

108
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:47,840
Get someone here!

109
00:07:47,841 --> 00:07:51,159
A Taoist priest, a pastor, anyone!

110
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,160
Hurry up!

111
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:02,280
Actually, it doesn't matter what others think.

112
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:12,120
It's enough for those who love me to understand me.

113
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:15,920
How is she now?

114
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,440
Tell her,

115
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,120
"Let's go home together."

116
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:27,560
Senior said she's fine.

117
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:30,080
She will go home with you.

118
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:42,840
She...

119
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,080
Has she already left?

120
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:49,760
You've made your choice.

121
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:52,920
She made hers too.

122
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:14,040
Take care. Have a safe...

123
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,480
I understand.

124
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:43,120
Thank you.

125
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:48,600
Sze Ming was lucky to have met you all.

126
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,440
Goodbye.

127
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,320
You should go first.

128
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:36,480
I'm going to the underworld in Australia.

129
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:40,080
This will be the last time we meet.

130
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:45,320
I hope I can be reincarnated in Australia...

131
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,680
without waiting as long as in Hong Kong.

132
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,480
It doesn't matter.

133
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:52,000
Being human isn't necessarily better than being a ghost.

134
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:05,720
Take care.

135
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:12,400
You lecture others, but you don't think about yourself.

136
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,520
I know you're a good person.

137
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:23,320
But sometimes, you have to be a jerk to protect yourself.

138
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:29,960
I hope you will soon be as free as I am.

139
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:37,720
I hope I can do that before I die.

140
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:40,760
I don't want to end up like you.

141
00:12:38,680 --> 00:12:39,680
Who is it?

142
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,680
Yau Yam Yam!

143
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,160
What now?

144
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:46,200
The line hasn't reached my heart yet.

145
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:47,840
You can't take me away yet.

146
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:50,080
You really only care about yourself.

147
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:51,400
They saw you last time.

148
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,120
Now I'm in a lot of trouble!

149
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,400
How serious is it?

150
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,440
There's nothing I can't handle.

151
00:12:57,920 --> 00:12:59,320
Fine, if you say so.

152
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:01,120
Anyway, we're in the same boat now.

153
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,440
Come down here right now.

154
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:04,440
- Right now? - Now!

155
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,480
("The Emperor's Handbook")

156
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,080
Your Majesty.

157
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,799
The God of War says...

158
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:46,480
you allowed a mortal to return to life.

159
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:48,320
Is that true?

160
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:53,520
I didn't expect the God of War, who is usually so loyal,

161
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:55,080
to snitch on me behind my back.

162
00:13:55,280 --> 00:13:57,800
I'm not snitching.

163
00:13:58,080 --> 00:14:01,320
I'm leading by example.

164
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:03,280
I'm reporting you...

165
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:06,240
because justice flows through my veins.

166
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:09,680
If anything unjust or against the rules...

167
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:10,960
happens in front of me,

168
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:14,760
I will handle it by the book.

169
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:18,000
By the book? You want to talk rules?

170
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:19,800
What about all the times I've gone easy on you?

171
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:21,040
You're biting the hand that feeds you.

172
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,200
Wait.

173
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:25,560
Leniency and rules are two different things.

174
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:28,120
How can you be so unprofessional?

175
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:30,280
You say they're different when it suits you,

176
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:31,680
but you conflate them when it doesn't.

177
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:33,080
You're so deceitful, you should be called the God of Deceit.

178
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:34,640
Enough, stop arguing.

179
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:39,640
The God of War is just doing his duty.

180
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:41,000
Answer me.

181
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:43,120
Is it true or not?

182
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:52,920
It's true.

183
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:58,400
Actually, I'm already writing a report for you, Your Majesty.

184
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:00,360
I didn't just let anyone return to life.

185
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:02,720
Her case is special. She deserves this chance.

186
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:05,760
She deserves it? Are you kidding me?

187
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:06,880
I'm not.

188
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:09,079
She did do many bad things in the past,

189
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:10,080
but she now knows she was wrong.

190
00:15:10,081 --> 00:15:11,120
She has also done many good deeds.

191
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,760
She has helped both humans and ghosts.

192
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:13,920
I even have a deal with her.

193
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,040
If she does anything wrong again,

194
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:16,440
I'll bring her back immediately.

195
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,800
(The Defense Claims the Witness For the Prosecution Is Untrustworthy)

196
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:32,560
She really did do a lot of bad things before.

197
00:15:32,800 --> 00:15:34,960
I promise she won't do it again, Your Majesty.

198
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:39,360
Your Majesty, I know you are merciful.

199
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,720
Please give her a chance.

200
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:47,640
The handbook...

201
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:52,480
The handbook doesn't say what to do.

202
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:01,600
What's wrong? I've just finished probation.

203
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:03,960
My father is still watching me closely.

204
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:08,400
The Great One let you succeed him...

205
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:10,680
because he wanted you to bring in some fresh ideas.

206
00:16:10,920 --> 00:16:12,160
So I think...

207
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:14,480
you don't have to stick to the handbook all the time.

208
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,560
You're absolutely right.

209
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:21,440
Let me think about it.

210
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:26,760
I've got it.

211
00:16:27,760 --> 00:16:31,320
I recall page 2,349 should have it.

212
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:38,319
(Chapter 2,349)

213
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:39,320
It says here...

214
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:43,200
that an official's first mistake will result in a warning.

215
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:46,680
A second mistake leads to demotion.

216
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:51,320
A third will send them to the Path of Animals.

217
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:55,680
King Yama, listen carefully.

218
00:16:57,400 --> 00:16:59,760
I am now issuing your first warning.

219
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:03,400
If that Yau Yam Yam does bad things again...

220
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:05,160
and affects other people's lives,

221
00:17:05,360 --> 00:17:07,200
or causes trouble in the mortal realm,

222
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,760
not just her, but you will be punished too.

223
00:17:10,560 --> 00:17:12,400
Yes, sir. I'll keep an eye on her.

224
00:17:14,080 --> 00:17:15,680
So can Yau Yam Yam continue...

225
00:17:15,760 --> 00:17:17,040
to fulfill ghosts' last wishes?

226
00:17:19,280 --> 00:17:20,999
(Page 2,350)

227
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,440
The handbook says...

228
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:23,679
that the KPI for the Underworld...

229
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,600
is to reduce the number of malicious ghosts...

230
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:28,600
to bring order and prosperity.

231
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:32,280
Fine, I'll allow Yau Yam Yam to continue.

232
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,680
Do a few more cases.

233
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:36,680
If she can't meet the KPI, I'll stop this at any time.

234
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:38,600
Do more?

235
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:43,360
Yes, the handbook states the goal is meeting the KPI.

236
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:45,720
Do a few more cases and let me see...

237
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:47,760
if it really reduces malicious ghosts.

238
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,400
If it does work,

239
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:51,120
I'll create a permanent position.

240
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:54,320
Yes. Your Majesty is wise.

241
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:56,840
Now, go and do it immediately.

242
00:17:57,320 --> 00:18:01,120
If you do well, I'll consider letting you redeem yourself.

243
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:12,000
Thanks to your favorite God of War for ratting us out,

244
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:14,720
our fates are now linked together.

245
00:18:14,800 --> 00:18:16,200
If you make any mistakes,

246
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:17,680
I'll be doomed too.

247
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:20,160
Don't worry, I'm a good person.

248
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,560
I wouldn't even step on an ant.

249
00:18:21,720 --> 00:18:23,400
If I don't do bad things, you'll be fine too.

250
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:29,320
- Hurry and pick a case for me. - What?

251
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:31,719
The Emperor ordered us...

252
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:33,480
to help ghosts fulfill their last wishes.

253
00:18:33,760 --> 00:18:35,600
Hurry, pick the first one.

254
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:37,360
There are so many. How do I choose?

255
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:39,840
For the first one, we should pick one we're confident about.

256
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,000
Wait.

257
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:53,160
I recognize this person.

258
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:56,560
His girlfriend is a friend of my aunt.

259
00:18:58,360 --> 00:19:00,400
Better to work with someone familiar. Him it is.

260
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:01,920
Wait, I don't know him at all.

261
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,040
At least you know who he is.

262
00:19:03,120 --> 00:19:04,800
- I only know of him. - That's enough.

263
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:07,680
I'll arrange for you to meet Chow Kwai Hing.

264
00:19:07,760 --> 00:19:10,080
You had better stay sharp and do a good job.

265
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:11,400
Otherwise, we'll all suffer.

266
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:15,640
Also,

267
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:17,920
you need to leave your mentor.

268
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:19,760
If you continue this emotional affair,

269
00:19:19,840 --> 00:19:21,080
you will lose control one day.

270
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:22,920
No amount of merit will save you then.

271
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:31,160
What if he divorces his wife?

272
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:33,200
Would it be okay to be with him then?

273
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:36,280
You're usually so smart.

274
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:39,280
Why are you so foolish when it comes to your mentor?

275
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:16,400
Late-night snack?

276
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:18,320
I'm not hungry.

277
00:20:22,280 --> 00:20:24,520
Then can you go for a ride with me?

278
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:32,160
Are you taking them again?

279
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:37,760
Help me one last time.

280
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:40,720
Didn't you say your wife would help you quit?

281
00:20:43,080 --> 00:20:44,640
Forget it. Forget I said anything.

282
00:20:53,320 --> 00:20:54,880
If your current life is suffocating you,

283
00:20:54,960 --> 00:20:55,960
you have to change.

284
00:20:57,680 --> 00:20:58,680
I'm telling you this,

285
00:20:58,681 --> 00:21:00,120
not because I want you to be with me,

286
00:21:01,080 --> 00:21:02,320
but because I hope...

287
00:21:03,320 --> 00:21:05,960
that no matter who you're with or what you do,

288
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:07,400
you must change.

289
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:09,640
You can't escape by taking pills forever.

290
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:15,880
I just don't want to change.

291
00:21:17,560 --> 00:21:18,560
I've sacrificed a lot...

292
00:21:18,561 --> 00:21:20,320
to get the life and status I have today.

293
00:21:21,760 --> 00:21:22,880
I'm not like you.

294
00:21:23,560 --> 00:21:25,000
You still have so many possibilities.

295
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:28,640
But you're not happy at all.

296
00:21:36,840 --> 00:21:37,920
What is happiness?

297
00:21:41,560 --> 00:21:43,360
I know I have feelings for you.

298
00:21:44,480 --> 00:21:46,160
You're the only one...

299
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:49,200
I don't have to pretend to be perfect for.

300
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,720
But so what?

301
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:56,320
Can you be sure...

302
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:58,560
that we won't change in a few years?

303
00:22:01,600 --> 00:22:03,920
We might end up resenting each other.

304
00:22:04,520 --> 00:22:06,440
I'll be unhappy and back on the pills.

305
00:22:09,200 --> 00:22:11,040
Since the result is the same,

306
00:22:11,760 --> 00:22:12,960
why should I change anything?

307
00:22:21,640 --> 00:22:23,320
Life is inherently imperfect.

308
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:27,880
Everything involves a trade-off.

309
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:33,200
To choose one thing, you must give up another.

310
00:22:43,200 --> 00:22:44,680
I don't regret loving you.

311
00:22:48,640 --> 00:22:49,800
But I have to change.

312
00:22:52,560 --> 00:22:53,600
I don't care what I become.

313
00:22:55,960 --> 00:22:57,920
I won't go back to who I was before.

314
00:23:01,160 --> 00:23:02,160
I'm sorry.

315
00:23:03,840 --> 00:23:05,280
I won't buy pills for you anymore.

316
00:23:17,040 --> 00:23:18,560
Ms. Man, do you think...

317
00:23:18,640 --> 00:23:21,080
this is a strike against the conservatives...

318
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:24,000
in the fight for the rights of homosexuals?

319
00:23:24,720 --> 00:23:26,120
Actually, I never thought about fighting...

320
00:23:26,200 --> 00:23:27,240
or advocating for anything.

321
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:30,000
I'm doing this purely for my wife.

322
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:32,440
No matter how hard it is,

323
00:23:32,760 --> 00:23:34,040
I will do my absolute best...

324
00:23:34,120 --> 00:23:35,560
to fulfill my promise to her.

325
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:37,520
What is it that keeps you going?

326
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:42,400
I think it's love.

327
00:23:43,200 --> 00:23:44,480
Love gives me courage.

328
00:23:44,760 --> 00:23:46,360
It makes me do it regardless of the consequences.

329
00:23:47,200 --> 00:23:48,760
What are your plans after returning to Australia?

330
00:23:50,520 --> 00:23:52,480
I'll arrange my wife's funeral first...

331
00:23:53,400 --> 00:23:55,320
so she can rest in peace as soon as possible.

332
00:24:08,600 --> 00:24:11,240
Why doesn't anyone love me like that?

333
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:13,560
What did you eat today?

334
00:24:13,720 --> 00:24:16,320
I had siew mai and fish balls today.

335
00:24:16,800 --> 00:24:19,080
Don't go. I won't ask again. I was wrong.

336
00:24:19,560 --> 00:24:20,800
Go away!

337
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:23,840
- Don't go! Give me a chance! - Go away!

338
00:24:29,720 --> 00:24:30,720
Go away!

339
00:24:33,720 --> 00:24:34,720
You really deserve a beating!

340
00:24:37,600 --> 00:24:38,720
You're such a glutton for punishment!

341
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:40,920
Go away!

342
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:56,560
It's all your fault!

343
00:24:57,160 --> 00:24:59,040
He hates kids the most!

344
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:02,840
He left because of you!

345
00:25:26,040 --> 00:25:28,120
- Hello? - Is this Yau Yam Yam?

346
00:25:28,360 --> 00:25:29,520
We're from the Regional Crime Unit.

347
00:25:37,840 --> 00:25:38,840
Over here.

348
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:41,200
Tell the police quickly.

349
00:25:41,201 --> 00:25:42,880
Tell them you're Chan Fat's lawyer.

350
00:25:43,200 --> 00:25:44,240
Who's Chan Fat?

351
00:25:45,560 --> 00:25:46,560
My husband.

352
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:04,840
She's here. The barrister is here.

353
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:06,960
We can start now.

354
00:26:07,440 --> 00:26:09,080
You really do specialize in helping scumbags.

355
00:26:09,680 --> 00:26:11,560
Officer, how can you say that?

356
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:13,800
I'm a law-abiding citizen. You're slandering me.

357
00:26:14,160 --> 00:26:16,960
With a barrister here, she'll send you a legal letter.

358
00:26:17,040 --> 00:26:18,840
Shut up. No one asked you to speak.

359
00:26:19,720 --> 00:26:22,280
Fine, I always listen to pretty girls.

360
00:26:23,280 --> 00:26:26,040
I'm Counselor Yau, Chan Fat's lawyer.

361
00:26:26,640 --> 00:26:28,840
We're ready. You can start recording.

362
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:35,320
I'm Detective 5423, Ho Cheuk Yiu.

363
00:26:36,080 --> 00:26:38,120
Stationed at the Kowloon West Regional Crime Unit.

364
00:26:38,560 --> 00:26:39,560
I'm now taking your statement.

365
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:42,400
The entire process will be recorded.

366
00:26:43,120 --> 00:26:44,520
You have the right to remain silent.

367
00:26:45,120 --> 00:26:46,200
But anything you say...

368
00:26:46,280 --> 00:26:48,040
may be used as evidence in court.

369
00:26:48,520 --> 00:26:49,560
You should know this best.

370
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:52,000
What is your name?

371
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:54,160
Chan Fat.

372
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:58,080
Do you know Shum Wai Lok?

373
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:04,040
If you don't want to answer, you can say, "No comment."

374
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:07,920
No comment.

375
00:27:10,080 --> 00:27:12,040
On February 15, 2024,

376
00:27:12,400 --> 00:27:14,480
Shum Wai Lok called you to say the goods had arrived.

377
00:27:14,560 --> 00:27:16,080
He asked you to collect them, right?

378
00:27:23,160 --> 00:27:24,279
Same thing.

379
00:27:24,280 --> 00:27:26,200
If you don't want to answer, you can say, "No comment."

380
00:27:27,600 --> 00:27:28,600
No comment.

381
00:27:32,320 --> 00:27:34,880
Then may I ask, in March 2024...

382
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:37,920
Mr. Chan, is it true that no matter what the police ask,

383
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:39,240
you will just say, "No comment"?

384
00:27:41,080 --> 00:27:42,080
Yes.

385
00:27:42,640 --> 00:27:44,320
I'm busy and need to eat. No comment.

386
00:27:46,800 --> 00:27:47,800
Officer,

387
00:27:49,040 --> 00:27:50,200
Mr. Chan has stated multiple times...

388
00:27:50,280 --> 00:27:51,720
that he will not answer your questions.

389
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:54,960
Whatever you ask, he will just say, "No comment."

390
00:27:56,080 --> 00:27:58,240
If you have enough evidence, then charge my client directly.

391
00:27:58,920 --> 00:28:00,120
Otherwise, even if you keep asking...

392
00:28:00,200 --> 00:28:02,080
for 48 hours, you won't get anything.

393
00:28:02,720 --> 00:28:05,160
There's no need to waste everyone's time, right?

394
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:16,160
Are you hungry? Did they do anything to you?

395
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:18,200
Silly, I'm fine.

396
00:28:18,520 --> 00:28:20,360
Those cops just have too much time on their hands.

397
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:21,680
They have no evidence at all.

398
00:28:23,920 --> 00:28:26,440
Your niece is quite capable.

399
00:28:27,640 --> 00:28:30,080
I might need your help with something later.

400
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:32,000
Yes, you must help him.

401
00:28:32,320 --> 00:28:33,560
He's being framed.

402
00:28:35,080 --> 00:28:36,080
What exactly happened?

403
00:28:36,160 --> 00:28:37,320
Why don't I know anything?

404
00:28:38,080 --> 00:28:39,280
He and I...

405
00:28:40,760 --> 00:28:41,760
What's wrong?

406
00:28:42,400 --> 00:28:43,400
Again?

407
00:28:43,880 --> 00:28:44,880
What is it?

408
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:46,640
It's nothing. She has been like this lately.

409
00:28:47,080 --> 00:28:48,080
She'll be fine in a moment.

410
00:28:49,120 --> 00:28:50,400
No, it looks serious.

411
00:28:51,080 --> 00:28:52,840
It's fine. Just take her home.

412
00:28:52,920 --> 00:28:54,079
Let's go.

413
00:28:54,080 --> 00:28:55,080
Don't touch her!

414
00:28:55,081 --> 00:28:56,200
Why are you clinging to my aunt?

415
00:28:56,280 --> 00:28:57,360
Officer, call an ambulance.

416
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:06,280
Who is Ms. Cheng's next of kin?

417
00:29:06,600 --> 00:29:07,720
- I'm her niece. - I'm her husband.

418
00:29:09,640 --> 00:29:11,000
The lab report is out.

419
00:29:11,480 --> 00:29:13,480
The patient's pancreatic tumor shows signs of spreading.

420
00:29:14,040 --> 00:29:15,800
The cancer cells are invading the main vein.

421
00:29:16,280 --> 00:29:17,480
The prognosis isn't great.

422
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:19,440
But at this stage,

423
00:29:19,480 --> 00:29:21,040
surgical resection is still an option.

424
00:29:21,800 --> 00:29:24,000
If you agree, I'll schedule a date.

425
00:29:25,200 --> 00:29:26,440
We... We need to think about it.

426
00:29:27,600 --> 00:29:29,520
The surgery must be done as soon as possible. Don't delay.

427
00:29:29,880 --> 00:29:31,480
Okay, I'll discuss it with my wife.

428
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:35,600
What is there to discuss?

429
00:29:36,160 --> 00:29:37,440
Why not have the surgery immediately?

430
00:29:38,320 --> 00:29:40,400
We have to see what your aunt thinks.

431
00:29:40,600 --> 00:29:41,880
We must respect her wishes.

432
00:29:42,080 --> 00:29:45,040
What is there to think about? Surgery is the only way.

433
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:47,640
I don't want the surgery.

434
00:29:48,360 --> 00:29:50,160
Did you hear that? You're awake?

435
00:29:51,200 --> 00:29:52,680
It's already spreading.

436
00:29:53,520 --> 00:29:55,720
If you don't do it now, it'll be too late later.

437
00:29:56,120 --> 00:29:58,560
No, Fat knows a Chinese physician.

438
00:29:58,880 --> 00:30:00,080
Surgery isn't required.

439
00:30:00,160 --> 00:30:01,519
I'll take herbal medicine...

440
00:30:01,520 --> 00:30:03,600
and practice qigong to purge the toxins.

441
00:30:04,080 --> 00:30:06,600
He's amazing. He can even cure terminal cases.

442
00:30:07,960 --> 00:30:10,160
Stop it. You actually believe that?

443
00:30:10,600 --> 00:30:11,840
That's a scam.

444
00:30:12,240 --> 00:30:13,920
What's wrong? I trust Fat.

445
00:30:14,120 --> 00:30:16,080
He wouldn't hurt me.

446
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:25,120
You would rather trust him than me?

447
00:30:26,960 --> 00:30:29,760
What's wrong? He's my husband.

448
00:30:30,080 --> 00:30:31,400
He wouldn't want me to die.

449
00:30:34,240 --> 00:30:36,680
If you want to gamble with your life, fine, I don't care.

450
00:30:41,040 --> 00:30:42,280
You have to help him.

451
00:30:42,840 --> 00:30:44,520
Yau Yam Yam, you owe me.

452
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:50,040
He's your husband. He has nothing to do with me.

453
00:30:53,480 --> 00:30:54,520
I'll go talk to her.

454
00:30:56,520 --> 00:30:58,040
Hey, beautiful. Don't go.

455
00:30:58,120 --> 00:30:59,120
Hey.

456
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:01,720
Why are you leaving so fast? Are you afraid of me?

457
00:31:04,280 --> 00:31:06,840
Trafficking over 15kg of cocaine...

458
00:31:07,360 --> 00:31:09,400
usually carries a sentence of over 30 years.

459
00:31:10,080 --> 00:31:12,360
Plus, if I rat you out for what happened with Dee,

460
00:31:12,960 --> 00:31:14,400
you will spend the rest of your life in prison.

461
00:31:14,640 --> 00:31:15,720
I know.

462
00:31:16,520 --> 00:31:18,640
But I'm still your uncle after all.

463
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:20,320
This situation is a bit tricky.

464
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:22,720
But you're so smart, I'm sure you'll help me.

465
00:31:22,800 --> 00:31:24,080
After all, we're family.

466
00:31:25,040 --> 00:31:27,600
Save it. Don't try to play the family card with me.

467
00:31:31,120 --> 00:31:32,120
Actually,

468
00:31:32,800 --> 00:31:34,440
I originally wanted you to give me 20 million dollars.

469
00:31:34,520 --> 00:31:36,040
Then I would divorce your aunt immediately.

470
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:38,280
But I'm in a bit of trouble now.

471
00:31:39,120 --> 00:31:40,920
How about this? You settle this for me.

472
00:31:41,480 --> 00:31:42,720
Tell that idiot to plead guilty to everything.

473
00:31:43,080 --> 00:31:45,600
I'll give you a discount. 15 million will do.

474
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:48,040
Are you out of your mind? Why would I help you?

475
00:31:48,520 --> 00:31:49,960
As long as I'm still her husband,

476
00:31:50,480 --> 00:31:52,520
whether she gets surgery or which doctor she sees,

477
00:31:52,800 --> 00:31:54,520
what meds she takes, how she's treated,

478
00:31:54,840 --> 00:31:56,560
and how her estate is handled after death...

479
00:31:56,880 --> 00:31:58,360
is all up to me.

480
00:31:59,320 --> 00:32:00,320
You settle this for me,

481
00:32:00,560 --> 00:32:01,920
and I'll tell her to have the surgery right away.

482
00:32:05,720 --> 00:32:09,280
Honestly, that Chinese physician isn't very good.

483
00:32:11,640 --> 00:32:12,880
You really are a scumbag.

484
00:32:13,880 --> 00:32:15,000
Takes one to know one.

485
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:19,720
I have plenty of time. Take your time to think about it.

486
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:30,440
Buddy, welcome back!

487
00:32:31,320 --> 00:32:32,720
- It hurts. - Sorry.

488
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:34,000
Let me help you inside.

489
00:32:34,320 --> 00:32:35,399
No need.

490
00:32:35,400 --> 00:32:37,160
Amber's car is making a weird noise.

491
00:32:37,240 --> 00:32:38,240
Go take a look for her.

492
00:32:38,880 --> 00:32:39,880
Thanks.

493
00:32:41,680 --> 00:32:42,680
Call me when you get back.

494
00:32:46,720 --> 00:32:48,480
Remember Chan Fat, the one who caught you last time?

495
00:32:50,240 --> 00:32:52,040
Of course. Why?

496
00:32:53,560 --> 00:32:55,320
- What's his deal? - He's dangerous.

497
00:32:55,720 --> 00:32:57,240
He used to be a hitman.

498
00:32:57,320 --> 00:32:59,600
He fled to Taiwan and hid for over a decade.

499
00:33:00,280 --> 00:33:02,080
Recently, he has been back working for Dee.

500
00:33:03,480 --> 00:33:05,640
That guy will do any dirty work for money.

501
00:33:06,120 --> 00:33:09,280
He used to be a gigolo. He's a real smooth talker.

502
00:33:09,360 --> 00:33:10,440
He specializes in swindling women.

503
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:12,520
Now that Dee is in jail,

504
00:33:12,600 --> 00:33:14,440
he has lost his income and might go back to his old tricks.

505
00:33:16,280 --> 00:33:18,680
Can you find the women he has swindled?

506
00:33:20,880 --> 00:33:22,960
There are many. It'll be tough.

507
00:33:23,680 --> 00:33:25,640
You'll be paid for it. Treat it as a freelance job.

508
00:33:27,560 --> 00:33:28,920
Then it won't be so tough.

509
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:42,480
Hello, Lok.

510
00:33:42,640 --> 00:33:44,720
I'm Counselor Yau, and this is Solicitor Lam.

511
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:48,040
We're here today to learn more about your case.

512
00:33:49,280 --> 00:33:50,600
I don't have any money.

513
00:33:51,600 --> 00:33:53,080
Don't worry about the money.

514
00:33:54,600 --> 00:33:56,960
Can you tell us again what happened that day?

515
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:06,840
Why are you only eating rice?

516
00:34:07,880 --> 00:34:09,680
I just bought this downstairs.

517
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:11,960
The boss said the chicken is good, so I saved it for you.

518
00:34:12,080 --> 00:34:14,400
My mom met Fat two years ago.

519
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:16,920
After that, they moved in together.

520
00:34:17,760 --> 00:34:19,200
Fat was quite nice to me.

521
00:34:19,680 --> 00:34:21,280
Fat, it's your turn to shower.

522
00:34:22,200 --> 00:34:23,200
Is there still hot water?

523
00:34:23,520 --> 00:34:25,240
I only showered for five minutes.

524
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:26,680
Only five minutes?

525
00:34:27,240 --> 00:34:28,920
This old-fashioned water-storage heater...

526
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:30,520
is only enough for three people.

527
00:34:30,600 --> 00:34:32,400
And your mom doesn't know how to save hot water.

528
00:34:34,640 --> 00:34:36,240
Actually, you're all grown up now.

529
00:34:36,640 --> 00:34:37,920
Shouldn't you move out?

530
00:34:41,480 --> 00:34:45,520
I want to, but the rent is too expensive.

531
00:34:45,840 --> 00:34:46,880
I don't have the money.

532
00:34:48,720 --> 00:34:50,120
I'll support you.

533
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:54,440
I want more alone time with your mom.

534
00:34:54,520 --> 00:34:55,520
Do you understand?

535
00:34:58,960 --> 00:35:00,560
So I moved out after that.

536
00:35:01,040 --> 00:35:02,320
Fat paid my rent.

537
00:35:03,640 --> 00:35:05,160
He has never been to my place.

538
00:35:13,240 --> 00:35:14,960
I occasionally help him collect deliveries.

539
00:35:15,680 --> 00:35:17,080
It's usually a boxed package.

540
00:35:17,840 --> 00:35:18,960
I've never opened them...

541
00:35:19,040 --> 00:35:20,880
or asked what was inside.

542
00:35:26,840 --> 00:35:29,520
Fat would ask me to go downstairs to give him the goods.

543
00:35:30,880 --> 00:35:32,400
He would also give me the rent money.

544
00:35:34,240 --> 00:35:38,040
One day, I was collecting a delivery for him as usual.

545
00:35:39,120 --> 00:35:40,200
Please sign for this.

546
00:35:40,840 --> 00:35:42,120
But as soon as I accepted the package,

547
00:35:42,840 --> 00:35:44,800
several cops rushed out and accused me of drug trafficking.

548
00:35:46,120 --> 00:35:47,600
Do you have any records...

549
00:35:47,760 --> 00:35:49,680
proving that Chan Fat rented that place for you...

550
00:35:49,760 --> 00:35:52,280
or any records proving that he paid your rent?

551
00:35:54,520 --> 00:35:56,480
The rental arrangement was all verbal.

552
00:35:57,000 --> 00:35:59,320
He told me never to text him.

553
00:35:59,680 --> 00:36:01,560
He said my mom checks his phone,

554
00:36:01,960 --> 00:36:04,240
and he didn't want her to know he was paying my rent.

555
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:07,400
And he always gave me cash.

556
00:36:08,160 --> 00:36:10,480
So there's no record of any transfers.

557
00:36:11,680 --> 00:36:13,960
Think carefully. Is there really nothing?

558
00:36:17,720 --> 00:36:18,720
Nothing.

559
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:23,720
Will this matter affect Fat?

560
00:36:25,240 --> 00:36:26,720
The police said they'll question him.

561
00:36:26,800 --> 00:36:28,440
I feel a bit bad about it.

562
00:36:31,720 --> 00:36:34,640
No, you didn't cause him any trouble.

563
00:36:36,920 --> 00:36:38,120
That's good then.

564
00:36:39,720 --> 00:36:42,600
But those goods really were for Fat.

565
00:36:43,480 --> 00:36:45,240
Will someone come after him?

566
00:36:46,040 --> 00:36:47,400
Will he be okay?

567
00:36:50,400 --> 00:36:52,240
It's obvious Chan Fat was using Lok.

568
00:36:52,960 --> 00:36:54,640
Now let's see how much evidence the police can dig up.

569
00:36:55,840 --> 00:36:57,440
Lok looks like such an honest fellow.

570
00:36:57,720 --> 00:36:59,080
His answers are consistent every time.

571
00:37:00,240 --> 00:37:02,880
Will the jury believe him in court?

572
00:37:03,960 --> 00:37:04,960
There's a chance we can win.

573
00:37:06,640 --> 00:37:08,400
I'll take this case. You handle it for me.

574
00:37:11,800 --> 00:37:12,800
Okay.

575
00:37:36,480 --> 00:37:38,240
King of Hell, I need to talk to you.

576
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:43,560
Please come out for a moment.

577
00:37:46,760 --> 00:37:48,080
I have something to ask you.

578
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:49,920
It's urgent.

579
00:37:51,120 --> 00:37:52,120
Please, hurry up.

580
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:07,800
The King of Hell wants to talk to you too.

581
00:38:23,520 --> 00:38:24,760
Just enjoy the music.

582
00:38:34,520 --> 00:38:35,640
Just so you know,

583
00:38:36,440 --> 00:38:38,120
I used to drink here all the time.

584
00:38:38,560 --> 00:38:40,240
After I became the King of Hell,

585
00:38:40,320 --> 00:38:41,520
I didn't have many chances to come back.

586
00:38:42,600 --> 00:38:44,000
I was born a deity.

587
00:38:44,760 --> 00:38:47,120
But I was never a particularly powerful one.

588
00:38:48,520 --> 00:38:50,000
A regional King of Hell...

589
00:38:50,720 --> 00:38:54,320
is just at the bottom of the divine hierarchy.

590
00:38:58,160 --> 00:39:00,400
Don't think being the King of Hell is fun.

591
00:39:02,240 --> 00:39:04,320
It's tedious.

592
00:39:04,600 --> 00:39:06,800
Judging cases every single day.

593
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:08,320
Let me tell you,

594
00:39:09,400 --> 00:39:13,680
human sins never decrease.

595
00:39:14,840 --> 00:39:16,920
For hundreds, thousands of years,

596
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:18,800
it's just the same thing over and over.

597
00:39:18,880 --> 00:39:20,200
Just punishing them.

598
00:39:20,280 --> 00:39:22,280
Punishing them constantly...

599
00:39:22,360 --> 00:39:23,840
in an endless cycle of reincarnation.

600
00:39:27,280 --> 00:39:29,480
I really felt this job was meaningless.

601
00:39:30,360 --> 00:39:31,920
So I started taking bribes.

602
00:39:32,560 --> 00:39:34,080
I started indulging in food and drink.

603
00:39:34,560 --> 00:39:36,280
How else was I supposed to get by?

604
00:39:45,560 --> 00:39:47,280
I want to do something more meaningful.

605
00:39:47,360 --> 00:39:48,520
I don't want to just punish people.

606
00:39:48,600 --> 00:39:51,400
I want to change. I want to do some good.

607
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:54,000
Why make it seem like I'm the one in the wrong?

608
00:39:54,080 --> 00:39:55,080
Why?

609
00:39:58,000 --> 00:40:00,840
Chow Kwai Hing, you two should talk.

610
00:40:01,720 --> 00:40:03,160
Sort it out as soon as possible, okay?

611
00:40:03,600 --> 00:40:04,600
Wait.

612
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:07,480
I have something important to ask you.

613
00:40:09,480 --> 00:40:10,920
How much longer can my aunt live?

614
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:14,200
Don't waste your energy. I won't answer you.

615
00:40:14,560 --> 00:40:16,040
I really need to know.

616
00:40:19,080 --> 00:40:21,880
Because if she's dying and I can't change it,

617
00:40:22,520 --> 00:40:23,960
then I'll focus on dealing with Chan Fat.

618
00:40:24,800 --> 00:40:26,160
But if it's not her time yet,

619
00:40:26,960 --> 00:40:28,400
then I'll be forced to help Chan Fat.

620
00:40:37,840 --> 00:40:39,360
Heaven's secrets cannot be revealed.

621
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:43,160
Yau Yam Yam, you're so smart.

622
00:40:43,240 --> 00:40:44,440
I'm sure you'll find a way.

623
00:40:45,040 --> 00:40:46,040
That's all for now.

624
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:52,360
Counselor Yau, hello. It's a pleasure to meet you.

625
00:40:52,680 --> 00:40:54,800
Thank you for helping me fulfill my last wish.

626
00:40:55,640 --> 00:40:56,680
Just tell me what it is.

627
00:41:02,160 --> 00:41:03,400
I'll help you find Ms. Mui.

628
00:41:04,440 --> 00:41:06,760
Thank you. Goodbye.

629
00:41:08,320 --> 00:41:09,320
Wait.

630
00:41:10,960 --> 00:41:12,480
I need your help with something.

631
00:41:14,360 --> 00:41:15,360
What is it?

632
00:41:15,361 --> 00:41:18,160
Didn't you use to be a police informant?

633
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:21,440
I used to be in business and knew a lot of people.

634
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:24,479
I did it a few times after I went bankrupt.

635
00:41:24,480 --> 00:41:25,480
It was purely to make ends meet.

636
00:41:25,481 --> 00:41:27,000
Then you must be good at finding people.

637
00:41:28,880 --> 00:41:29,920
Help me find them.

638
00:41:36,400 --> 00:41:37,400
But...

639
00:41:37,680 --> 00:41:39,840
You help me, and I'll help you.

640
00:42:04,360 --> 00:42:05,479
Hello?

641
00:42:05,480 --> 00:42:06,840
Help me check the legal aid records...

642
00:42:06,920 --> 00:42:09,640
for the case of Wong Suet Mui and her boyfriend, Chow Kwai Hing.

643
00:42:12,120 --> 00:42:13,120
Hello?

644
00:42:15,720 --> 00:42:16,880
I'll send you an address now.

645
00:42:16,960 --> 00:42:18,480
Tell them to gather there immediately.

646
00:42:46,080 --> 00:42:47,920
What brings you here? Did you miss me?
